    <div class="quick-item" onclick="showOperatorInfo()"><div class="q-icon">🧩</div><div class="q-info"><div class="q-title">算子库信息</div><div class="q-desc">V3.2.0 · 17个算子</div></div><div class="q-arrow">›</div></div>
    <div class="quick-item" onclick="alert('ZONGYUAN-ROOT 政务AI中台 V4.0 算子化架构版')"><div class="q-icon">ℹ️</div><div class="q-info"><div class="q-title">关于平台</div><div class="q-desc">ZONGYUAN-ROOT 政务AI中台</div></div><div class="q-arrow">›</div></div>
  </div>
